WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.491 --> 00:00:04.087
(singing) ... (screams loudly)

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:07.087
(suspenseful music)

00:00:08.182 --> 00:00:11.515
(lightheart jazz music)

00:00:21.226 --> 00:00:23.893
- Not today, Playboy. Not today.

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:29.379
(screams loudly)

00:00:29.379 --> 00:00:32.200
Hello, 911. Yes, I have an emergency.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:35.797
There is an aggressive spider
that refuses to leave my home.

00:00:35.797 --> 00:00:39.812
Did I mention that the spider
was on top of a burglar?

00:00:39.812 --> 00:00:43.568
How could we not have
any Raid in this house?

00:00:43.568 --> 00:00:47.210
A bug not gonna stop me from
watching TV. This is my house.

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:50.627
(TV plays in background)

00:00:56.362 --> 00:00:59.641
I already seen this
episode of Maury anyway!

00:00:59.641 --> 00:01:03.473
Does PAM cooking spray kill spiders?

00:01:03.473 --> 00:01:07.799
Look, Fam, if you leave
right now, just out the door,

00:01:07.799 --> 00:01:11.135
I promise to never kill
any of your homies again.

00:01:11.135 --> 00:01:14.802
Bees, flies, ants, other
arachnid ...things.

00:01:19.597 --> 00:01:21.185
Please leave.

00:01:21.185 --> 00:01:23.051
I'm not yelling. I'm not yelling.

00:01:23.051 --> 00:01:25.875
If a spider comes into your home, okay...

00:01:25.875 --> 00:01:28.482
And they say, "Hey I'm a spider.

00:01:28.482 --> 00:01:30.557
I don't care if I didn't get an invite.

00:01:30.557 --> 00:01:31.825
This is where I want to be."

00:01:31.825 --> 00:01:36.061
What are you gonna do? What
are you gonna do? Do your job!

00:01:36.061 --> 00:01:36.894
Not today.

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:42.120
(chuckles) Got you, sucker.

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:43.120
Houdini bug!

00:01:45.662 --> 00:01:48.662
(suspenseful music)

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:53.410
The game has changed.

00:01:54.430 --> 00:01:57.263
(soft jazz music)

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:01.790
- What are you doing?

00:02:02.669 --> 00:02:05.435
- I don't wanna talk about it.

00:02:05.435 --> 00:02:09.352
- Whatever. Where'd you
get the briefcase from?

00:02:12.864 --> 00:02:15.443
Goddamn that. C'mon, we gotta go.

00:02:15.443 --> 00:02:17.505
Did you see the size of that thing?

00:02:17.505 --> 00:02:19.421
Bitch, you ain't just out
just here. - I know, I know.

00:02:19.421 --> 00:02:20.571
- We've gotta go. - I know.

00:02:20.571 --> 00:02:21.404
- Ride in the back.

00:02:21.404 --> 00:02:22.467
- I've got matches.

00:02:22.467 --> 00:02:26.634
- [Man] Burn it down. C'mon,
burn it down. Let's go.

